{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods", "label": "Karvey 3.11.1 Review: Development-Methods Judge (DM)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mature in diagnosis/evidence culture, immature in executables; method must scale with change size and validate rules with code."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_01", "label": "DM-01: Lanes by change size with recorded phase skips", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Process cost must be proportional to risk (Shape Up appetite, DORA small batches); without a cheap legit path teams take an illegit one."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_02", "label": "DM-02: Single state machine with JSON schema and executable linter", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A prose-only state machine interpreted by an LLM is nondeterministic."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_03", "label": "DM-03: Release per change, not by promoting the environment branch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Env-branch promotion mixes yours with others'; trunk-based per-change release reduces blast radius."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_04", "label": "DM-04: Single version bump moment and coherent gate order (Keep a Changelog)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Semver versions releases, not commits; per-commit bumps create trivial merge conflicts."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_05", "label": "DM-05: Hooks must do what rules say, with tests (bats)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If the only deterministic layer does less than declared, the team believes in a nonexistent guarantee."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_06", "label": "DM-06: Fewer, heavier human gates; remove silent auto-approval", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A gate that almost always approves yields little information and much waiting (rubber stamp)."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_07", "label": "DM-07: Test-first and verifiable REQ->task->commit->test traceability matrix", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "TDD fixes the contract first; EARS works best when every SHALL has a verifier."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_08", "label": "DM-08: Security gate with deterministic tools, not only LLM judgment", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LLM-only blocking gate is not reproducible; OWASP SAMM/SLSA ask for automated controls."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_09", "label": "DM-09: Living specs: merge spec-delta in the code PR, not after prod", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Living documentation updates in the same atomic unit as behavior."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_10", "label": "DM-10: Turn canary into post-deploy verification with numeric thresholds and rollback", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without thresholds, 'regression' is an opinion; DORA CFR/MTTR need defined criteria."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_11", "label": "DM-11: Flow metrics (DORA + method rework) computed from artifacts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DORA metrics are the delivery standard; rework metrics show if earlier phases do their job."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_12", "label": "DM-12: Remove rule copies and give the plugin a light CI", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DRY and treat-method-as-code; doc drift already caused a behavior bug."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_13", "label": "DM-13: Project-level design system; design-graphic as optional delta", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Design systems exist to avoid redesigning every feature (same split as living spec vs spec-delta)."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_14", "label": "DM-14: QA observes without fixing; artifacts inside the change; stack rules to standards", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four-eyes separation of reviewer and implementer; per-change artifacts avoid parallel crossover."}, {"id": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_15", "label": "DM-15: Lower per-task overhead (knowledge-sync, tracker ritual) and fix time logging", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lean: work that changes no decision is waste; overwriting the estimate is a data bug."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods", "target": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_01", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_01", "target": "plugins_karvey_skills_karvey_skill", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/spec/reviews/2026-09-23-judge-dev-methods.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_spec_reviews_2026_09_23_judge_dev_methods_dm_01", "target": "plugins_karvey_skills_karvey_architecture_skill", "relation": "references", "con